  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Wilkinson catalyst<br /><br /><math><mo>[</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>]</mo></math><br /><br />Metal with 4d<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;and 5d<sup>8</sup>&nbsp;Configuration always forms&nbsp; square planar complexes on account of higher CFSE irrespective of&nbsp;weak field or strong field. The magnetic property is diamagnetic.<br /><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5080fe3a-0b9e-474b-a85a-8301685de95c-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 250px;\" /></p></blockquote>",
